          "text": "$25\\text{ cm}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$18\\text{ cm}$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "Perimeter $= 2(l + w)$, so $36 = 2(11 + w)$, giving $18 = 11 + w$, hence $w = 7\\text{ cm}$."
